d 'XTPANELGARCH': module for panel GARCH models: estimation, pre-testing and diagnostics 
d
d      xtpanelgarch brings conditional heteroskedasticity into
d panel data. Each subcommand implements one estimator from the   
d panel-GARCH literature exactly as written in its source paper and
d reports tables in the format used by those papers: a mean   
d block, a variance block, a covariance block, and a "volatility
d dynamics" block (persistence, half-life, positive-definiteness   
d checks). 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: GARCH
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261106
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f xtpanelgarch.ado
f xtpanelgarch.sthlp
f ../_/_xtpg_balance.ado
f ../l/lxtpanelgarch.mlib
f xtpanelgarch_armagarch.ado
f xtpanelgarch_armagarch.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_cg.ado
f xtpanelgarch_cg.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_cl.ado
f xtpanelgarch_cl.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_cluster.ado
f xtpanelgarch_cluster.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_estat.ado
f xtpanelgarch_example.do
f xtpanelgarch_hgarch.ado
f xtpanelgarch_hgarch.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_mata.mata
f xtpanelgarch_methods.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_msgarch.ado
f xtpanelgarch_msgarch.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_p.ado
f xtpanelgarch_postestimation.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_pretest.ado
f xtpanelgarch_pretest.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_qgarch.ado
f xtpanelgarch_qgarch.sthlp
f xtpanelgarch_vt.ado
f xtpanelgarch_vt.sthlp
